<ArticleLayout title="About · Aayush ICT" description="Who I am, and how I trade.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>I'm Aayush. MA in Psychology. Six years around markets. Funded futures trader.</p>
  <p>This site is the written home of my reels. Macro events connected to real price in Gold,
  NQ and the Dollar, read through ICT.</p>

  <h2>How I trade</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Instrument:</strong> NQ and MNQ only. I watch Gold and the Dollar for correlation, I don't trade them.</li>
    <li><strong>Method:</strong> ICT and Smart Money Concepts.</li>
    <li><strong>Process:</strong> I confirm what is priced in on the daily chart, then drop to intraday for the entry.</li>
    <li><strong>Risk rule:</strong> TODO. I'll write my stop and reward to risk here, in my own words.</li>
    <li><strong>Funded with:</strong> Apex Trader Funding.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Why psychology and markets are one topic for me</h2>
  <p>I studied psychology before I studied markets. The chart is a record of decisions.
  Reading price and reading a decision are the same skill for me.</p>

  <h2>What this is not</h2>
  <p>This is not a signal service. I do not tell you what to trade. I show you what I watch,
  what I read, and what I do. Trade your own plan.</p>

